        "text": {
         "nodes": [
          {
           "type": "TEXT_NODE_TYPE_WORD",
           "word": {
            "words": "所以这一期我研究了好久，最后想出了一个可能是办法的办法，记录一下，也请大佬指教，因为网上关于这个的内容实在是有点少",
            "font_size": 17,
            "color": "",
            "dark_color": "",
            "style": {
             "bold": false,
             "italic": false,
             "strikethrough": false,
             "underline": false,
             "background": ""
            },
            "font_level": "",
            "translated_words": "",
            "bili_theme": "",
            "bg_style": null
           },
           "rich": null,
           "formula": null,
           "user": null
          }
         ]
        },
        "pic": null,
        "line": null,
        "list": null,
        "link_card": null,
        "code": null,
        "heading": null,
        "blockquote": null
       },
       {
        "para_type": 1,
        "align": 0,
        "format": {
         "align": 0,
         "indent": null
        },
        "text": {
         "nodes": [
          {
           "type": "TEXT_NODE_TYPE_WORD",
           "word": {
            "words": "所以我本来是这么想的，通过找到检测调试器的代码，然后把这些代码给Hook了。但是这样显然就会遇到一个问题。那就是首先需要静态分析找到反调试的代码。这样的工作量巨大，而且有一些动态调用涉及到大量的指针操作，要找到指针的指向又需要用调试器，但是反调试机制又不让我们调试，所以是一个非常棘手的问题。",
            "font_size": 17,
            "color": "",
            "dark_color": "",
            "style": {
             "bold": false,
             "italic": false,
             "strikethrough": false,
             "underline": false,
             "background": ""
            },
            "font_level": "",
            "translated_words": "",
            "bili_theme": "",
            "bg_style": null
           },
           "rich": null,
           "formula": null,
           "user": null
          }
         ]
        },
        "pic": null,
        "line": null,
        "list": null,
        "link_card": null,
        "code": null,
        "heading": null,
        "blockquote": null
       },
       {
        "para_type": 1,
        "align": 0,
        "format": {
         "align": 0,
         "indent": null
        },
        "text": {
         "nodes": [
          {
           "type": "TEXT_NODE_TYPE_WORD",
           "word": {
            "words": "方案二就是使用虚拟机，但是我不喜欢这个方案，因为我的电脑比较差（一个后端开发人员的电脑居然很差）。所以我也没有这么做",
            "font_size": 17,
            "color": "",
            "dark_color": "",
            "style": {
             "bold": false,
             "italic": false,
             "strikethrough": false,
             "underline": false,
             "background": ""
            },
            "font_level": "",
            "translated_words": "",
            "bili_theme": "",
            "bg_style": null
           },
           "rich": null,
           "formula": null,
           "user": null
          }
         ]
        },
        "pic": null,
        "line": null,
        "list": null,
        "link_card": null,
        "code": null,
        "heading": null,
        "blockquote": null
       },
       {
        "para_type": 1,
        "align": 0,
        "format": {
         "align": 0,
         "indent": null
        },
        "text": {
         "nodes": [
          {
           "type": "TEXT_NODE_TYPE_WORD",
           "word": {
            "words": "所以我想选择一些反反调试器。所以我就选择了ScyllaHide来反反调试。从GitHub上下载了ScyllaHide的插件，然后又把它装到了x32GDB上，然后点击plugin -&gt; ScyllaHide -&gt; AttachProcess中，然后把PID填写进去，大概就是这样：",
            "font_size": 17,
            "color": "",
            "dark_color": "",
            "style": {
             "bold": false,
             "italic": false,
             "strikethrough": false,
             "underline": false,
             "background": ""
            },
            "font_level": "",
            "translated_words": "",
            "bili_theme": "",
            "bg_style": null
           },
           "rich": null,
           "formula": null,
           "user": null
          }
         ]
        },
        "pic": null,
        "line": null,
        "list": null,
        "link_card": null,
        "code": null,
        "heading": null,
        "blockquote": null
       },
       {
        "para_type": 2,
        "align": 0,
        "format": {
         "align": 0,
         "indent": null
        },
        "text": null,
        "pic": {
         "pics": [
          {
           "url": "https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/article/6d9acfda3915dae114880d5106cbb75be20deeb4.png",
           "width": 430,
           "height": 360,
           "size": 53.6875,
           "live_url": "",
           "aigc": 0,
           "warning": null,
           "comment": ""
          }
         ],
         "style": 2
        },
        "line": null,
        "list": null,
        "link_card": null,
        "code": null,
        "heading": null,
        "blockquote": null
       },
       {
        "para_type": 1,
        "align": 1,
        "format": {
         "align": 1,
         "indent": null
        },
        "text": {
         "nodes": [
          {
           "type": "TEXT_NODE_TYPE_WORD",
           "word": {
            "words": "这里应该会显示EXE path",
            "font_size": 17,
            "color": "#999999",
            "dark_color": "",
            "style": {
             "bold": false,
             "italic": false,
             "strikethrough": false,
             "underline": false,
             "background": ""
            },
            "font_level": "",
